{
  "name": "Cookie-Free LinkedIn Profile & Work Email Enrichment to Google Sheets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ Cookie-Free LinkedIn Profile & Work Email Enrichment to Google Sheets\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nEnrich LinkedIn profile URLs or executive search queries with verified work emails and titles without LinkedIn cookies, then append directly to Google Sheets / Clay.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/linkedin-profile-scraper`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/linkedin-profile-scraper) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify LinkedIn Profile & Email Scraper No Cookies** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract, deduplicate, and score live structured JSON records!",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 640
      },
      "id": "bb9893bf-5967-444a-af9b-99b5b48ad80a",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🔎 Stage 1: Schedule, Target Queries & Apify Extraction\nTriggers daily, sets your target search queries and `maxItems`, and runs the cookie-free **LinkedIn Profile & Email Scraper No Cookies** Actor synchronously via the Apify REST API.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 740
      },
      "id": "d3b7f80d-e9bc-4e8f-ab27-283def6e3267",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 1 Extraction",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🧹 Stage 2: Quality Filtering, Deduplication, Lead Scoring & Export\nFilters verified records, deduplicates by URL/ID, normalizes and scores each record with JavaScript, summarizes the batch, and routes high-priority items downstream.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 980
      },
      "id": "686a3678-13a0-445d-ab34-9a5d17a28a3d",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 2 Processing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        950,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 24
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "afeae00d-735c-41f2-ad72-6ce0ffee59de",
      "name": "Daily Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        200,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "a824a7df-eba1-4823-a901-5cd0a0b346f4",
              "name": "queries",
              "value": "[\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/satyanadella\",\"VP of Sales B2B SaaS San Francisco\"]",
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "id": "d61b0e29-f98f-4b1b-a66b-2b5da0980a78",
              "name": "maxItems",
              "value": 25,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "5b10fb64-3fc9-497f-af15-424151cb47bd",
              "name": "pipelineCategory",
              "value": "LinkedIn & B2B",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d7cd97fd-68ef-4a78-acbb-fa6309450304",
      "name": "Configure Target Queries",
